## Decision trail

`.gifisi/decisions.tsv` is an append-only log with the columns `ts`, `phase`, `decision`, `why`, `evidence` and `result`. Append rows with `node "{{HARNESS_HOME}}scripts/log-decision.mjs" <phase> <decision> <why> <evidence> <result>`. Evidence is a pointer: a path, `file:line`, a commit or a command. A wrong row gets a superseding row; rows are never edited.

## Corrections

`.gifisi/corrections.md` pairs each recurring mistake with what enforces it: architecture (tier 1), a lint rule or test (tier 2), or text (tier 3). A rule enforced only by text that recurs moves up a tier.

