## Review

Scope a review to the risk and the actual diff. Use an independent reviewer for non-trivial work when one is available. Record the exact target, the callers, contracts and tests inspected, the findings and their outcome. Finish when relevant findings are resolved or have an explicit destination and the affected checks pass.

